    "cc_faq_wPHYzdsdasddx": {
      "type": "cc-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_bBK86k": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will I be able to access the course materials after I finish the course?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, you'll be able to access the course for life. </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_Jz9hVT": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the course Live or Pre-recorded?",
            "content": "<p>The course is made up of pre recorded videos. Some are presentations with voiceover and some are videos of your teacher Giselle talking.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_XzNY3t": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the course accredited?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, the course has been accredited by the IPHM - The International Practitioners of Holistic Medicine</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_B34NFh": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need to do any training before I take the course?",
            "content": "<p>No, the course has no prerequisites. You can be a complete beginner or an experienced practitioner in massage, reflexology, acupuncture, energy healing etc. to study this course.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_ktNcYe": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much is the course?",
            "content": "<p>The course is £599 (inc VAT) if you pay in full or you can pay in monthly instalments. If you pay over 2 months, there will be two payments of £325 (inc VAT). If you pay over 3 months, there will be 3 payments of £230 (inc VAT).</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_UGzTDa": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will there be an exam at the end of the course?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, there is a short multiple choice exam which will test your knowledge on ear seeds, the anatomy of the ear, the different points etc. Once you have passed with 70%, you will receive a certificate of completion. If you don’t pass, you can take the test again until you do. </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_CByEFx": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Once I have completed the course, will I be able to practise on clients?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, once you complete the course and receive the certificate, you will be able to take out insurance so that you can start practising on clients. Our recommended insurance provider in the UK is given in the course material, but there are other providers worldwide who will cover you for ear acupressure/auriculotherapy/ear seeding. </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_4DBVaW": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long will the course take to complete?",
            "content": "<p>There are 5 modules and it should take 12 hours to complete the course. We recommend that you work through the course slowly rather than rushing through the content. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
